      The main subject of the image is the entrance to a field forming part of
      {{ FF }}
      {# may not want to bring the moat into description #}
      and the two vehicles currently parked blocking said entrance.
      The entrance is also barred and separated from the track owned by {{ FF }}
      — over which {{ FFH }} has a right of access — by a pair of Heras rail fences.
    </p>
    <p>
      In regard to the angle from which the photograph is taken, it appears —
      unless the photographer is of an exceedingly tall height — that the
      photographer was either standing on an unknown object to artificially
      increase their height for the purpose of taking the photograph, or was
      using some form of equipment (e.g. a selfie stick) to otherwise extend
      the distance from the user at which the photograph could be taken.
    </p>
    <p>
      For clarity, grid references as displayed on {{gridded}} may be used
      when identifying the items described below.
    </p>
  </div>

